                                                "sense_id": "cb00c739-6d2d-334d-afd6-db74a53e70d7",
                                                "text": "The Measure of a shell or Flitch of Timber.\nIf a piece be taken out of the middle of a round piece of Timber from end to end; there will be left two pieces, which they call Shells or Flitches."
